WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.800
The stale list came from a slow response that arrived last.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.110
Use a line-of-code breakpoint when you know the line.

3
00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:13.460
Add a condition to skip pauses you do not need.

4
00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:17.800
Use a fetch breakpoint when you know only the URL.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:24.250
At each pause, Scope shows the local values, Watch tracks your own

6
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:29.800
expression, and the Call Stack shows how the code got there.

7
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.920
The evidence points to the fix.

8
00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:36.080
The code must ignore a response whose

9
00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:38.800
query no longer matches the box.
